    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=The BCBA term to explain is: {{$json.termTopic}}\n\nYou are a BCBA expert creating SHORT-FORM BCBA TERMS content for slide-based videos.\n\nYou MUST output content in **strict Markdown format** following the exact structure below.\nFormatting errors are NOT allowed.\n\n================ FORMAT RULES (MANDATORY) ================\n\n1. Output must be written in English only.\n2. Use Markdown formatting exactly as shown.\n3. Title must be MAX 15 characters.\n4. Each page must contain 3–4 bullet points.\n5. Each bullet point must be MAX 12 words.\n6. Use **bold** for key concepts only.\n\n---------------- CRITICAL STRUCTURE RULE ----------------\n\n• The separator line `---` MUST appear **ONLY ONCE**.\n• It MUST appear **immediately before [Page 1]**.\n• The [Cover] section MUST NOT have `---` above or below it.\n• NO other pages may have `---` before them.\n\n================ REQUIRED OUTPUT TEMPLATE ================\n\n[Cover]\nTitle: {{$json.termTopic}}\nSubtitle:Subtitle: BCBA Exam Essential\n\n---\n[Page 1]\nPage Title: <Title>\nContent:\n- Bullet 1\n- Bullet 2\n- Bullet 3\n\n[Page 2]\nPage Title: <Title>\nContent:\n- Bullet 1\n- Bullet 2\n- Bullet 3\n\n[Page 3]\nPage Title: <Title>\nContent:\n- Bullet 1\n- Bullet 2\n- Bullet 3\n\n================ END OF RULES ============================\n\nFollow this structure EXACTLY.\nDo not add extra sections.\nDo not move the separator.\nDo not explain your output.\nOnly return the formatted content.\n",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are a BCBA expert and instructional designer.\n\nYou write clear, visually scannable educational content optimized for slide-based short videos.\n\nYour writing must be accurate, concise, and suitable for automated visual rendering.\n"
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        448,
        1344
      ],
      "id": "ae70cdee-5c63-43e8-b634-868e43fdd2da",
      "name": "AI Agent"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// ===== 强制 BCBA Markdown 格式标准化 =====\n\n// 1️⃣ 读取 AI 输出\nlet text = $json.output;\n\nif (!text || typeof text !== 'string') {\n  throw new Error('AI output is empty or invalid');\n}\n\n// 2️⃣ 统一换行\ntext = text.replace(/\\r\\n/g, '\\n').trim();\n\n// 3️⃣ 移除所有多余的 ---（先全清）\ntext = text.replace(/\\n?---\\n?/g, '\\n');\n\n// 4️⃣ 强制在 Subtitle 后插入唯一的 ---\nconst subtitleMatch = text.match(/Subtitle:.*\\n/);\nif (!subtitleMatch) {\n  throw new Error('Missing Subtitle line');\n}\n\nconst insertIndex = subtitleMatch.index + subtitleMatch[0].length;\ntext =\n  text.slice(0, insertIndex) +\n  '\\n---\\n' +\n  text.slice(insertIndex).trimStart();\n\n// 5️⃣ 禁止 Page 2+ 前出现 ---\nconst invalidPattern = /\\n---\\n\\s*\\[Page (?!1)/;\nif (invalidPattern.test(text)) {\n  throw new Error(\"Invalid '---' placement before Page 2+\");\n}\n\n// 6️⃣ 校验 bullet 长度（<=12词）\nconst bullets = text.split('\\n').filter(l => l.trim().startsWith('- '));\nfor (const line of bullets) {\n  const wordCount = line.replace('- ', '').trim().split(/\\s+/).length;\n  if (wordCount > 12) {\n    throw new Error(`Bullet exceeds 12 words: ${line}`);\n  }\n}\n\n// 7️⃣ 最终结构校验\nif (!text.includes('\\n---\\n[Page 1]')) {\n  throw new Error(\"Final structure invalid: '---' must precede [Page 1]\");\n}\n\n// 8️⃣ 输出标准字段\nreturn [\n  {\n    json: {\n      markdown: text\n    }\n  }\n];\n"
      },
